[
{
"start": 13.62,
"end": 17.05,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Notion replaces the dozen tools your team is currently using, half the time.",
"char_start": 16,
"char_end": 92,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s02"
},
{
"start": 17.05,
"end": 18.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Try notion.com today.",
"char_start": 93,
"char_end": 114,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s03"
},
{
"start": 18.0,
"end": 24.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Before we get into the details \u2013 \u00c9lodie Chevalier was on the previous episode and said that tire pressure is more important than suspension settings.",
"char_start": 115,
"char_end": 264,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s04"
},
{
"start": 24.0,
"end": 25.24,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Yes, exactly.",
"char_start": 282,
"char_end": 295,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s01"
},
{
"start": 25.24,
"end": 30.0,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "And that ties in with what we're discussing today.",
"char_start": 296,
"char_end": 346,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s02"
},
{
"start": 30.0,
"end": 36.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "I want to point something out \u2013 \u00c9lodie Chevalier mentioned this same dynamic a few episodes ago.",
"char_start": 363,
"char_end": 459,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s01"
},
{
"start": 36.0,
"end": 40.51,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "I want to point something out \u2013 Julien Mercier mentioned this same dynamic a few episodes ago.",
"char_start": 460,
"char_end": 554,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s02"
},
{
"start": 40.51,
"end": 42.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "I want to explore this further.",
"char_start": 555,
"char_end": 586,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s03"
},
{
"start": 42.0,
"end": 48.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What did you believe about this topic, and what have you revised your views on?",
"char_start": 587,
"char_end": 666,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s04"
},
{
"start": 48.0,
"end": 51.26,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "It boils down to this: most mysterious creaking noises are resolved by cleaning the contact surfaces and tightening the bolts to the specified torque.",
"char_start": 684,
"char_end": 834,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s01"
},
{
"start": 51.26,
"end": 52.33,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 835,
"char_end": 884,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s02"
},
{
"start": 52.33,
"end": 54.0,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "The framing is important because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 885,
"char_end": 962,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s03"
},
{
"start": 54.0,
"end": 55.66,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "This is a useful perspective.",
"char_start": 979,
"char_end": 1008,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s01"
},
{
"start": 55.66,
"end": 60.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Where do the fields of human resources and transmission mechanics intersect?",
"char_start": 1009,
"char_end": 1085,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s02"
},
{
"start": 60.0,
"end": 60.66,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 1103,
"char_end": 1123,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s01"
},
{
"start": 60.66,
"end": 63.85,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "A bicycle should feel quiet and predictable so that your attention remains focused on the trail.",
"char_start": 1124,
"char_end": 1220,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s02"
},
{
"start": 63.85,
"end": 66.0,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "And the secondary effect is the part that almost everyone misses.",
"char_start": 1221,
"char_end": 1286,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s03"
},
{
"start": 66.0,
"end": 67.82,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "I want to explore this further.",
"char_start": 1303,
"char_end": 1334,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s01"
},
{
"start": 67.82,
"end": 72.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What is the structural aspect that most listeners don't have access to?",
"char_start": 1335,
"char_end": 1406,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s02"
},
{
"start": 72.0,
"end": 72.26,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Of course.",
"char_start": 1424,
"char_end": 1434,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s01"
},
{
"start": 72.26,
"end": 74.73,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "The wear and tear on the chain is the best indicator of when you'll need to replace the cassette.",
"char_start": 1435,
"char_end": 1532,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s02"
},
{
"start": 74.73,
"end": 75.98,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 1533,
"char_end": 1582,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s03"
},
{
"start": 75.98,
"end": 78.0,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "The frame geometry matters because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 1583,
"char_end": 1662,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s04"
},
{
"start": 78.0,
"end": 84.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Tell me more.",
"char_start": 1679,
"char_end": 1692,
"unit_id": "t0010.u01",
"sent_id": "t0010.s01"
},
{
"start": 84.0,
"end": 87.16,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Spoke & Wrench is one of the platforms where this is clearly evident.",
"char_start": 1710,
"char_end": 1779,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s01"
},
{
"start": 87.16,
"end": 90.0,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 1780,
"char_end": 1842,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s02"
},
{
"start": 90.0,
"end": 92.92,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Tell me how you came to that decision.",
"char_start": 1859,
"char_end": 1897,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s01"
},
{
"start": 92.92,
"end": 96.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "How does RockShox fit into this picture?",
"char_start": 1898,
"char_end": 1938,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s02"
},
{
"start": 96.0,
"end": 96.34,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Of course.",
"char_start": 1956,
"char_end": 1966,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s01"
},
{
"start": 96.34,
"end": 98.95,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "The maintenance intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
"char_start": 1967,
"char_end": 2043,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s02"
},
{
"start": 98.95,
"end": 102.0,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "If you ignore that, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 2044,
"char_end": 2133,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s03"
},
{
"start": 102.0,
"end": 102.42,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "You know what?",
"char_start": 2150,
"char_end": 2164,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s01"
},
{
"start": 102.42,
"end": 104.6,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "I'll be frank: Linear powers all of my engineering work on a daily basis.",
"char_start": 2165,
"char_end": 2238,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s02"
},
{
"start": 104.6,
"end": 106.99,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Linear is the ticketing system designed for speed \u2013 it's built for keyboard use.",
"char_start": 2239,
"char_end": 2319,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s03"
},
{
"start": 106.99,
"end": 108.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Use the link in the episode notes.",
"char_start": 2320,
"char_end": 2354,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s04"
},
{
"start": 126.0,
"end": 127.66,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "That's a helpful perspective.",
"char_start": 2355,
"char_end": 2384,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s02"
},
{
"start": 127.66,
"end": 132.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Where do the fields of human resources and transmission mechanics intersect?",
"char_start": 2385,
"char_end": 2461,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s03"
},
{
"start": 132.0,
"end": 132.45,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "This is how I see it.",
"char_start": 2479,
"char_end": 2500,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s01"
},
{
"start": 132.45,
"end": 135.4,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Most of these mysterious creaking noises can be resolved by cleaning the contact surfaces and tightening the bolts to the specified torque.",
"char_start": 2501,
"char_end": 2640,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s02"
},
{
"start": 135.4,
"end": 136.53,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Shimano components.",
"char_start": 2641,
"char_end": 2694,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s03"
},
{
"start": 136.53,
"end": 138.0,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 2695,
"char_end": 2764,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s04"
},
{
"start": 138.0,
"end": 139.46,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Give me a concrete example.",
"char_start": 2781,
"char_end": 2808,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s01"
},
{
"start": 139.46,
"end": 144.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What did you previously believe about this, and what have you revised your views on?",
"char_start": 2809,
"char_end": 2893,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s02"
},
{
"start": 144.0,
"end": 147.55,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Yes, so \u2013 a bike should feel quiet and predictable so that your attention remains focused on the trail.",
"char_start": 2911,
"char_end": 3014,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s01"
},
{
"start": 147.55,
"end": 150.0,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Once you've internalized that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 3015,
"char_end": 3086,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s02"
},
{
"start": 150.0,
"end": 151.43,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Let's start with that.",
"char_start": 3103,
"char_end": 3125,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s01"
},
{
"start": 151.43,
"end": 156.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What did you previously believe about this, and what have you revised?",
"char_start": 3126,
"char_end": 3196,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s02"
},
{
"start": 156.0,
"end": 156.51,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 3214,
"char_end": 3234,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s01"
},
{
"start": 156.51,
"end": 158.97,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "The wear and tear on the chain is the best indicator of when you'll need to replace the cassette.",
"char_start": 3235,
"char_end": 3332,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s02"
},
{
"start": 158.97,
"end": 160.32,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Shimano components.",
"char_start": 3333,
"char_end": 3386,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s03"
},
{
"start": 160.32,
"end": 162.0,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 3387,
"char_end": 3453,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s04"
},
{
"start": 162.0,
"end": 168.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "It's settled.\nAlternatively:\nIt's a done deal.\nIt's confirmed.\nIt's arranged.\nIt's agreed.",
"char_start": 3470,
"char_end": 3560,
"unit_id": "t0022.u01",
"sent_id": "t0022.s01"
},
{
"start": 168.0,
"end": 174.0,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "And when teams adopt Spoke & Wrench within this workflow, the trade-offs become apparent. If you ignore these trade-offs, you end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 3578,
"char_end": 3766,
"unit_id": "t0023.u01",
"sent_id": "t0023.s01"
},
{
"start": 174.0,
"end": 175.33,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Let's start with that.",
"char_start": 3783,
"char_end": 3805,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s01"
},
{
"start": 175.33,
"end": 180.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What is the operational perspective that most auditors do not have access to?",
"char_start": 3806,
"char_end": 3883,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s02"
},
{
"start": 180.0,
"end": 180.76,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 3901,
"char_end": 3921,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s01"
},
{
"start": 180.76,
"end": 183.65,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "The maintenance intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
"char_start": 3922,
"char_end": 3998,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s02"
},
{
"start": 183.65,
"end": 186.0,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 3999,
"char_end": 4061,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s03"
},
{
"start": 186.0,
"end": 192.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Let's change the subject \u2013 I want to dedicate the final section to risk management.",
"char_start": 4078,
"char_end": 4161,
"unit_id": "t0026.u01",
"sent_id": "t0026.s01"
},
{
"start": 192.0,
"end": 198.0,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "That's where the conversation becomes interesting, because the compromises related to risk management touch upon everything we've discussed.",
"char_start": 4179,
"char_end": 4319,
"unit_id": "t0027.u01",
"sent_id": "t0027.s01"
},
{
"start": 198.0,
"end": 199.76,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Give me a concrete example.",
"char_start": 4336,
"char_end": 4363,
"unit_id": "t0028.u01",
"sent_id": "t0028.s01"
},
{
"start": 199.76,
"end": 204.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of transmission mechanics?",
"char_start": 4364,
"char_end": 4429,
"unit_id": "t0028.u01",
"sent_id": "t0028.s02"
},
{
"start": 204.0,
"end": 204.25,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Of course.",
"char_start": 4447,
"char_end": 4457,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s01"
},
{
"start": 204.25,
"end": 207.44,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Most mysterious creaking noises can be resolved by cleaning the contact surfaces and tightening the bolts to the specified torque.",
"char_start": 4458,
"char_end": 4588,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s02"
},
{
"start": 207.44,
"end": 208.65,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 4589,
"char_end": 4638,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s03"
},
{
"start": 208.65,
"end": 210.0,
