"text": "I've seen this pattern repeat in three different teams.",
"char_start": 4639,
"char_end": 4694,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s04"
},
{
"start": 210.0,
"end": 211.69,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "This is a useful perspective.",
"char_start": 4711,
"char_end": 4740,
"unit_id": "t0030.u01",
"sent_id": "t0030.s01"
},
{
"start": 211.69,
"end": 216.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What is the contrarian viewpoint that most listeners don't have access to?",
"char_start": 4741,
"char_end": 4815,
"unit_id": "t0030.u01",
"sent_id": "t0030.s02"
},
{
"start": 216.0,
"end": 219.73,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "It all boils down to this: a bike should feel quiet and predictable so that your attention remains focused on the trail.",
"char_start": 4833,
"char_end": 4953,
"unit_id": "t0031.u01",
"sent_id": "t0031.s01"
},
{
"start": 219.73,
"end": 222.0,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "The geometry matters because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 4954,
"char_end": 5027,
"unit_id": "t0031.u01",
"sent_id": "t0031.s02"
},
{
"start": 222.0,
"end": 224.18,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What does the failure mode look like?",
"char_start": 5044,
"char_end": 5081,
"unit_id": "t0032.u01",
"sent_id": "t0032.s01"
},
{
"start": 224.18,
"end": 228.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of transmission mechanics?",
"char_start": 5082,
"char_end": 5147,
"unit_id": "t0032.u01",
"sent_id": "t0032.s02"
},
{
"start": 228.0,
