"end": 240.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Where is it no longer working?",
"char_start": 5410,
"char_end": 5440,
"unit_id": "t0034.u01",
"sent_id": "t0034.s01"
},
{
"start": 240.0,
"end": 246.0,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "And when teams adopt Shimano equipment, this compromise becomes apparent \u2013 I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5458,
"char_end": 5595,
"unit_id": "t0035.u01",
"sent_id": "t0035.s01"
},
{
"start": 246.0,
"end": 248.22,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What heuristic do you consistently rely on?",
"char_start": 5612,
"char_end": 5655,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s01"
},
{
"start": 248.22,
"end": 252.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Where do the fields of interviewing and transmission mechanics intersect?",
"char_start": 5656,
"char_end": 5729,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s02"
},
{
"start": 252.0,
"end": 255.35,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Honestly, the maintenance intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
"char_start": 5747,
"char_end": 5833,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s01"
},
{
"start": 255.35,
"end": 258.0,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone misses.",
"char_start": 5834,
"char_end": 5902,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s02"
},
{
"start": 258.0,
"end": 264.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Before we conclude, what is one thing that listeners can try this week?",
"char_start": 5919,
"char_end": 5990,
"unit_id": "t0038.u01",
"sent_id": "t0038.s01"
},
{
"start": 264.0,
"end": 267.96,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and implement it for two weeks.",
"char_start": 6008,
"char_end": 6076,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s01"
},
{
"start": 267.96,
"end": 270.0,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Everything else is about iteration.",
"char_start": 6077,
"char_end": 6112,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s02"
},
{
"start": 270.0,
"end": 272.52,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Before we conclude, thank you again to our friends at Linear.",
"char_start": 6129,
"char_end": 6190,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s01"
},
{
"start": 272.52,
"end": 276.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Linear is the ticketing system designed for speed \u2013 built with the keyboard in mind.",
"char_start": 6191,
"char_end": 6275,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s02"
},
{
"start": 276.0,
"end": 282.0,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre, thank you for the conversation.",
"char_start": 6276,
"char_end": 6324,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s03"
},
{
